From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bryan Hoban <bryan.hoban@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 13:11:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] ffmpeg: rpi: H.264 MVC multiview decoding

Dom Cobley's H.264 MVC series (FFmpeg pull request 24303), backported
to 9.0: the h264 decoder outputs the dependent view of Blu-ray 3D and 3D
camcorder streams, which Kodi's stereoscopic playback uses.

Signed-off-by: Bryan Hoban <bryan.hoban@gmail.com>
