+From: Bryan Hoban <bryan.hoban@gmail.com>
+Subject: [PATCH] avcodec/h264: H.264 MVC (Annex H) multiview decoding, backported to 9.0
+
+Dom Cobley's H.264 MVC series (FFmpeg pull request 24303, head
+24bbc58460), with the h264 changes from master it builds on, on 9.0.2.
+The decoder outputs the dependent view of an MVC stream (Blu-ray 3D,
+3D camcorder recordings) when asked to with view_ids; by default only the
